  "descriptions": {
    "en": "Local modular 2D characters with synchronized TTS mouth animation. Includes Boba Animals, Kenney Monster Builder, and a vector character builder with no external avatar API costs.",
    "de": "Lokale modulare 2D-Figuren mit synchronisierter TTS-Mundanimation. Enthält Boba Animals, Kenney Monster Builder und einen Vector Character Builder ohne Bildgenerierungs-APIs."
  }
